WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,570
What do you want to do?

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,900
Just a performance prop

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:05,860
What are you nervous about?

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:10,380
You two take it easy and I'll go back and tease you first.

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,660
Who really has that kind heart?

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,100
Personal belongings in the box in the future

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,660
Don't use it as a game prop, just play it, don't get more into it

8
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,140
Miao Xiner Zhang Min

9
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,740
As long as you help me for a long time

10
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,740
One ticket for three days

11
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,180
Others want the same

12
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,540
What about the people we have been following you?

13
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,900
Shouldn't there be more right ones?

14
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,340
We were with you as early as possible

15
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:27,780
Of course you have

16
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,780
Just depends on the contribution

17
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,500
Miao Xin'er and the others just came here and they had a ticket for three days. How about I spend the next few days?

18
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,660
I'll help you keep an eye on people and carry water. I'll count your contribution as much as the harvest.

19
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,940
I followed you from the earliest

20
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,540
You can't marry someone who just arrived, right?

21
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,740
Never calculated it this way before

22
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,700
Then start from today

23
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,700
Calculate the past clearly

24
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,740
Work starts tomorrow

25
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,020
I'll be in charge of grouping and relaying

26
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,500
You are responsible for acceptance and settlement

27
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,620
I am responsible for technical standards

28
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,540
Say it first

29
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,780
Counterattack must be distinguished

30
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,780
Who has the design problem and who has the construction problem?

31
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,780
Not all pots

32
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:56,020
You can blame it all on the people who do the work.

33
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,300
I will sign up for Wu Dingzu first

34
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,340
Are you afraid of heights?

35
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,300
Then I'll grab the noodles
